WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,290
Brother, you hurt me

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:04,330
Go Uncle Sang

3
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:21,120
What are you sorry for?

4
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,640
I just bumped into him accidentally

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,160
I'll leave it to you, don't worry

6
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:29,260
Today is different from the past. I am a father.

7
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:31,130
count you lucky

8
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,960
I let you bully my baby

9
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:40,280
Quickly, marry him to me and take the baby away

10
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,180
Uncle, I'm sorry for your uncle.

11
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:45,620
Uncle, good baby. I believe the baby is not good.

12
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,420
The baby is learning from the baby

13
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,780
The baby has not evolved at all

14
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,140
Brother, I'm sorry

15
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:55,980
I almost lost Rainbow Dash and Yun Qi

16
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:57,900
Crying in front of Rainbow Dash

17
00:00:58,260 --> 00:00:59,620
The little one will laugh at you

18
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:00,860
Uncle, good boy

19
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,780
Babies don’t laugh
